<h2 id="system-design">System Design <span class='count'>(33)</span></h2>
<div class="pdf-grid">
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Two-Phase Commit</h3><p>Atomic commits across distributed nodes — prepare/commit phases, blocking failure modes, and why 2PC is rarely used alone.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-2pc.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>API Gateways</h3><p>The front door of your APIs — routing, auth, rate limiting, request shaping, and gateway vs service mesh.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-api-gateway.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Bloom Filters</h3><p>Probabilistic membership tests — bit arrays, hash functions, false positives, and where Bloom filters shine.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-bloom-filters.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Caching &amp; CDNs</h3><p>Serve it once, serve it fast — cache-aside, invalidation strategies, edge networks, hit ratios, full-stack layers.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-caching-cdn.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Caching Strategies</h3><p>Cache-aside, read-through, write-through, write-behind — invalidation patterns and picking the right strategy.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-caching-strategies.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>CAP Theorem</h3><p>Consistency, Availability, Partition tolerance — pick two, and what that choice means for real distributed systems.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-cap-theorem.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Circuit Breakers</h3><p>Stop cascading failures — closed/open/half-open states, fallbacks, and bulkheads for resilient services.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-circuit-breaker.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Connection Pooling</h3><p>Stop paying the handshake tax — pool sizing, multiplexing, and keeping databases happy under load.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-connection-pooling.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Consensus Algorithms</h3><p>Getting distributed nodes to agree — Raft and Paxos, leader election, quorums, and log replication.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-consensus.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Consistent Hashing</h3><p>Distribute keys without reshuffling everything — hash rings, virtual nodes, and elastic scaling.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-consistent-hashing.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>CRDTs</h3><p>Conflict-free replicated data types — convergent state without coordination, and the math behind offline-first sync.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-crdts.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Event-Driven Architecture</h3><p>React to what happened — events, brokers, choreography vs orchestration, and decoupling with messages.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-event-driven.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Eventual Consistency</h3><p>Converging without waiting — read-your-writes, monotonic reads, and designing for weak consistency.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-eventual-consistency.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>GraphQL</h3><p>Query exactly what you need — schemas, resolvers, the N+1 problem, and GraphQL vs REST tradeoffs.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-graphql.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>gRPC</h3><p>High-performance RPC — Protocol Buffers, HTTP/2 multiplexing, streaming, and service-to-service calls.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-grpc.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>HTTP Caching</h3><p>Cache-Control, ETags, and conditional requests — making the web fast with correct caching headers.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-http-caching.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Idempotency</h3><p>Safe to retry — idempotency keys, exactly-once effects, and designing APIs that survive duplicates.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-idempotency.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Load Balancing</h3><p>How traffic gets distributed across servers for scale, speed, and survival — algorithms, health checks, L4 vs L7, global LB.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-load-balancing.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Message Queues</h3><p>Decouple with buffers — producers, consumers, dead-letter queues, and choosing the right queue.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-message-queues.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Microservices Architecture</h3><p>Decompose the monolith — service boundaries, sync vs async, resilience patterns, data ownership, observability.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-microservices.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Peer-to-Peer Networks</h3><p>No central server — DHTs, gossip, BitTorrent mechanics, and decentralized distribution.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-p2p.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Data Partitioning</h3><p>Splitting data across nodes — range, hash, and directory-based partitioning strategies.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-partitioning.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Proxies</h3><p>Forward and reverse proxies — load balancing, caching, TLS termination, and hiding your origin.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-proxies.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Rate Limiting</h3><p>Protecting APIs from abuse — token bucket, leaky bucket, sliding windows, and distributed limits.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-rate-limiting.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Real-Time Web</h3><p>Live updates — WebSockets, SSE, long polling, and pushing data the moment it changes.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-realtime-web.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Data Replication</h3><p>Copies in sync — leader-follower, multi-leader, quorum reads/writes, and replication lag.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-replication.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>REST API Design</h3><p>Resources, verbs, and status codes — versioning, pagination, HATEOAS, and APIs developers love.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-rest-design.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>The Saga Pattern</h3><p>Distributed transactions without 2PC — choreography, orchestration, and compensating actions.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-saga-pattern.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Scaling Systems</h3><p>Vertical vs horizontal — read replicas, sharding, caching layers, and the scaling playbook.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-scaling.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Service Discovery</h3><p>Finding services dynamically — DNS, registries, sidecars, and health-aware routing.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-service-discovery.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Service Mesh</h3><p>Sidecars for everything — Istio/Linkerd, mTLS, traffic policies, and observability at the mesh layer.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-service-mesh.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>Vector Clocks</h3><p>Ordering events without a global clock — causality, happens-before, and conflict detection.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-vector-clocks.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">System Design</span><h3>WebSockets</h3><p>Full-duplex over HTTP — handshakes, frames, scaling stateful connections, and real-time patterns.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-websockets.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
</div>

<h2 id="networking">Networking <span class='count'>(19)</span></h2>
<div class="pdf-grid">
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>Anycast Routing</h3><p>One IP, many servers — how anycast steers traffic to the nearest node for DNS, CDNs, and DDoS absorption.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-anycast.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>ARP &amp; ICMP</h3><p>How machines find each other on a LAN — ARP requests, ICMP pings, traceroute, and the tools of layer 2/3 discovery.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-arp-icmp.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>DHCP</h3><p>Getting an IP automatically — discover, offer, request, ack, leases, and the protocol behind plug-and-play networking.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-dhcp.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>DNS Resolution</h3><p>From name to IP in milliseconds — caches, root, TLD, authoritative servers, record types, DNSSEC, DoT/DoH.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-dns-resolution.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>DNS Security</h3><p>Protecting name resolution — DNSSEC, DoT/DoH, cache poisoning defenses, and DNS-layer threat intel.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-dns-security.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>HTTP/2 &amp; HTTP/3</h3><p>Multiplexing, header compression, and QUIC — how the web protocol got faster and more resilient.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-http2-http3.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>IPv4 &amp; IPv6</h3><p>Address exhaustion and the fix — CIDR, NAT, IPv6 notation, dual-stack, and the transition playbook.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-ipv4-ipv6.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>NAT</h3><p>Sharing one public IP — port address translation, NAT types, and how home networks reach the internet.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-nat.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>The OSI Model</h3><p>Seven layers of networking — from physical bits to application protocols, and where everything lives.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-osi-model.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>QUIC</h3><p>UDP-based transport for the modern web — 0-RTT, migration, and the protocol powering HTTP/3.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-quic.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>Routing Protocols</h3><p>How packets find paths — BGP, OSPF, distance vector vs link state, and internet-scale routing.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-routing-protocols.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>Software-Defined Networking</h3><p>Programmable networks — control/data plane separation, OpenFlow, and network automation.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-sdn.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>Subnets &amp; CIDR</h3><p>Carving up IP space — netmasks, CIDR notation, subnet math, and designing address plans.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-subnets-cidr.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>TCP 3-Way Handshake</h3><p>How two machines agree to talk reliably — SYN, SYN-ACK, ACK, sequence numbers, flow control, and the 4-way goodbye.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-tcp-handshake.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>TCP Teardown</h3><p>Saying goodbye properly — FIN/ACK exchanges, TIME_WAIT, half-close, and cleaning up connections.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-tcp-teardown.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>TLS Handshake</h3><p>How HTTPS builds a private tunnel — ClientHello, certificates, ECDHE key exchange, forward secrecy, TLS 1.3.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-tls-handshake.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>UDP</h3><p>Fast and connectionless — datagrams, when UDP beats TCP, and the protocols built on top.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-udp.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>VLANs</h3><p>Virtual LANs — segmentation with 802.1Q tagging, trunk ports, and isolating traffic on shared switches.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-vlans.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Networking</span><h3>VPNs</h3><p>Private tunnels over public networks — IPsec, WireGuard, split tunneling, and remote access.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-vpns.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
</div>

<h2 id="cloud-&-devops">Cloud &amp; DevOps <span class='count'>(27)</span></h2>
<div class="pdf-grid">
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Autoscaling</h3><p>Scale out when busy, scale in when idle — metrics, cooldowns, target tracking, and predictive scaling.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-autoscaling.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>AWS Core Services</h3><p>The AWS essentials — EC2, S3, VPC, IAM, RDS, Lambda — and how the pieces fit together.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-aws-core.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Azure Core Services</h3><p>The Azure essentials — VMs, Blob Storage, VNets, Entra ID, App Service — and how the pieces fit together.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-azure-core.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Blue-Green Deployments</h3><p>Zero-downtime releases — running two environments, flipping traffic, and instant rollback when things break.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-blue-green.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Canary Deployments</h3><p>Roll out to 1% first — traffic shifting, automated analysis, and catching regressions before everyone sees them.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-canary.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Chaos Engineering</h3><p>Break things on purpose — blast radius, steady-state hypotheses, game days, and building antifragile systems.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-chaos.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>CI/CD Pipelines</h3><p>From git push to production — stages of trust, security gates, deployment strategies, GitOps, DORA metrics.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-cicd-pipeline.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Cloud Architecture Patterns</h3><p>Regions, AZs, auto-scaling, stateless services, queues, infrastructure as code, and the well-architected checklist.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-cloud-patterns.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Containers vs VMs</h3><p>Isolation compared — namespaces and cgroups vs hypervisors, overhead, startup, and when to use each.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-containers-vms.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Cloud Cost Optimization</h3><p>Stop the bill shock — rightsizing, spot instances, commitment discounts, tagging, and FinOps habits.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-cost-optimization.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Disaster Recovery</h3><p>Surviving the worst day — RTO/RPO, backup strategies, multi-region failover, and tested runbooks.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-disaster-recovery.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Docker, In Depth</h3><p>Images, layers, and runtimes — Dockerfile best practices, build cache, multi-stage builds, and the OCI standard.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-docker-deep.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>The ELK Stack</h3><p>Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana — centralized logging, parsing pipelines, and dashboards for your systems.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-elk.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
<div class="pdf-card"><span class="pdf-cat">Cloud &amp; DevOps</span><h3>Feature Flags</h3><p>Ship dark, release gradually — targeting, kill switches, trunk-based development, and flag hygiene.</p><a class="btn" href="/assets/pdfs/bbg-feature-flags.pdf">Read the guide</a><div class="pdf-meta">8 pages · animated walkthrough</div></div>
